{
  "info": {
    "name": "GSGchat: API para GSG",
    "description": "Las llamadas que GSG hace a GSGchat: recibir pedidos (API 1), cancelar o reintentar (API 2), consultar y corregir.\n\nAntes de usarla: importa también el entorno «GSGchat», pon en él la dirección del servidor (baseUrl) y la API Key (apiKey), y elígelo arriba a la derecha.\n\nLa API Key se crea en GSGchat, Nuestra API, Claves. Va en la cabecera X-API-Key, nunca en la URL ni en el cuerpo.\n\nEl contrato completo está en /api/v1/openapi.json del mismo servidor.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "apikey",
    "apikey": [
      {
        "key": "key",
        "value": "X-API-Key",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "value",
        "value": "{{apiKey}}",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "in",
        "value": "header",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "tracking",
      "value": "GSG-E-205",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "El tracking de los ejemplos. Cámbialo por uno nuevo para crear otro pedido."
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Recibir pedidos (API 1)",
      "description": "GSG manda los pedidos del día a POST /api/v1/entregas. Hasta 600 por llamada; un pedido repetido el mismo día no se duplica.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Crear un pedido",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('responde 200 o 201', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"tracking\": \"{{tracking}}\",\n  \"empresa\": \"Tienda Uno\",\n  \"cliente\": \"Ana Pérez\",\n  \"telefono\": \"987654321\",\n  \"metodoPago\": \"Efectivo\",\n  \"montoCobrar\": 85,\n  \"distrito\": \"Lince\",\n  \"direccion\": \"Av. Lima 123\",\n  \"fecRuta\": \"2026-10-03\",\n  \"telefono2\": \"988777666\",\n  \"producto\": \"Zapatos\",\n  \"cantBultos\": 2\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/entregas",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "entregas"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Con un tracking nuevo responde 201 y el pedido con su id. Si se manda otra vez el mismo día responde 200 y lo trae en «existentes»."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Creado",
              "status": "Created",
              "code": 201,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"creadas\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 1,\n      \"referencia\": \"GSG-E-205\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"repetidas\": [],\n  \"descartadas\": [],\n  \"whatsapp\": [],\n  \"detalle\": \"1 pedido nuevo.\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Ya estaba (repetido)",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"creadas\": [],\n  \"repetidas\": [\n    \"GSG-E-205\"\n  ],\n  \"existentes\": [\n    {\n      \"referencia\": \"GSG-E-205\",\n      \"id\": 1\n    }\n  ],\n  \"detalle\": \"Nada nuevo.\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Error: falta el teléfono",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('responde 400', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([400]); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"tracking\": \"{{tracking}}\",\n  \"empresa\": \"Tienda Uno\",\n  \"cliente\": \"Ana Pérez\",\n  \"metodoPago\": \"Efectivo\",\n  \"montoCobrar\": 85,\n  \"distrito\": \"Lince\",\n  \"direccion\": \"Av. Lima 123\",\n  \"fecRuta\": \"2026-10-03\",\n  \"telefono2\": \"988777666\",\n  \"producto\": \"Zapatos\",\n  \"cantBultos\": 2\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/entregas",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "entregas"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Sin un campo obligatorio responde 400 y no guarda ningún pedido de la llamada. «detalles» dice qué campo de qué pedido."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Falta un campo",
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"ok\": false,\n  \"codigo\": \"VALIDACION\",\n  \"error\": \"Algún campo falta o no tiene el formato esperado.\",\n  \"detalles\": [\n    {\n      \"campo\": \"pedidos[0].telefono\",\n      \"mensaje\": \"falta (es obligatorio)\",\n      \"pedido\": 1\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Error: sin la API Key",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('responde 401', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([401]); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"tracking\": \"{{tracking}}\",\n  \"empresa\": \"Tienda Uno\",\n  \"cliente\": \"Ana Pérez\",\n  \"telefono\": \"987654321\",\n  \"metodoPago\": \"Efectivo\",\n  \"montoCobrar\": 85,\n  \"distrito\": \"Lince\",\n  \"direccion\": \"Av. Lima 123\",\n  \"fecRuta\": \"2026-10-03\",\n  \"telefono2\": \"988777666\",\n  \"producto\": \"Zapatos\",\n  \"cantBultos\": 2\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/entregas",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "entregas"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Sin la cabecera X-API-Key responde 401. Con una clave inventada o revocada, también 401."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Sin clave",
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"ok\": false,\n  \"codigo\": \"CLAVE_AUSENTE\",\n  \"error\": \"Falta la clave de API.\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Consultar",
      "description": "Lo que GSG puede leer cuando quiera. GSGchat nunca se lo empuja.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Un pedido de hoy",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('responde 200', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200]); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/entregas/{{tracking}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "entregas",
                "{{tracking}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Cómo va ese pedido hoy, con sus eventos. Se busca por su referencia (el tracking, si GSG no mandó otra)."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Encontrado",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"entrega\": {\n    \"referencia\": \"GSG-E-205\"\n  },\n  \"eventos\": []\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "No hay pedido hoy con esa referencia",
              "status": "Not Found",
              "code": 404,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"ok\": false,\n  \"codigo\": \"NO_EXISTE\",\n  \"error\": \"Lo que se pide no existe (o ya no).\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Lo hecho por WhatsApp con cada tracking",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('responde 200', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200]); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/trackings?dia=",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "trackings"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "dia",
                  "value": ""
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Por tracking: mensaje enviado, ubicación pedida o registrada, confirmación, agrupado y reportado. «dia» en AAAA-MM-DD; vacío, hoy."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Hoy",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"dia\": \"2026-10-17\",\n  \"total\": 0,\n  \"trackings\": []\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Números reportados pendientes",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('responde 200', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200]); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reportados?estado=pendiente",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "reportados"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "estado",
                  "value": "pendiente"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Los teléfonos y trackings malos que GSGchat guardó para GSG. «estado»: pendiente o corregido; vacío, todos."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Pendientes",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"total\": 0,\n  \"items\": []\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Corregir datos",
      "description": "Cambiar los datos de un pedido de hoy o corregir un número reportado.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Cambiar la dirección de un pedido",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('responde 200', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200]); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"direccion\": \"Av. Arequipa 456\",\n  \"distrito\": \"Lince\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/entregas/{{tracking}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "entregas",
                "{{tracking}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Se puede cambiar nombre, dirección, distrito, notas, urgente, los datos del envío o el teléfono. Un pedido entregado o cancelado responde 409."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Cambiado",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"cambios\": [\n    \"dirección\"\n  ],\n  \"entrega\": {\n    \"referencia\": \"GSG-E-205\"\n  },\n  \"detalle\": \"Pedido actualizado.\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Ya entregado o cancelado",
              "status": "Conflict",
              "code": 409,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"ok\": false,\n  \"codigo\": \"CONFLICTO\",\n  \"error\": \"Choca con el estado actual.\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Corregir un número reportado",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
